  "notes": "COMMON MEANINGS:\nAs a standalone noun, {定期|ていき} usually means 'commuter pass' ({定期券|ていきけん}). As a prefix, it means 'regular' or 'fixed-term.'\n\nCOMMON COMPOUND WORDS:\n・{定期券|ていきけん} (commuter pass)\n・{定期|ていき}{検査|けんさ} (regular inspection/checkup)\n・{定期|ていき}{預金|よきん}/{貯金|ちょきん} (fixed-term deposit)\n・{定期|ていき}{便|びん} (regular service, scheduled flight)\n・{定期|ていき}{試験|しけん} (regular examination)\n\nANTONYM:\n・{不定期|ふていき} (irregular, non-scheduled)",
